fixes up distant sounds to support volume and panning.
adds and changes some sounds.
Removes the music.
New in 1.16
Tries to add speaking of zones.
Changed how the death code works. Now, when you die you have to wait at least 20 seconds before you can respawn. Once the 20 seconds are up, you will respawn with out having to press enter now. You also do not hear what's around when you are dead.
Added distent sounds!
New in 1.15
Security updates.
Adds sounds for motion bombs.
